## Executive Summary

Muse Wonder is Meta's flagship general-purpose model from their Muse Wonder series, released October 12, 2026, designed for personal and professional AI agents with memory capabilities, computer use, and strong performance on agentic benchmarks. It features a massive 1M token context window, multimodal input (text, image, video, audio), and competitive pricing ($4/$20 per 1M tokens). Wonder ranks #3 on Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index (52.4, 99th percentile), #2 on MemoryBench (85.6%), and #1 on DeepSWE 1.1 (78.8%). The model is available through Meta Model API and Muse Code subscribers, with Wonder Full available exclusively to Muse Code subscribers. Wonder costs 40% less than Claude Fable 5.1 per test task and matches Claude Opus 5.5 in pricing.

