## Use Cases

### Best For:
- Personal and professional AI agents
- Long-running workflows that require memory across conversations
- Computer use and automation tasks
- Organizations heavily invested in Meta ecosystem
- Cost-sensitive applications with good prompt caching strategies
- Multimodal applications requiring vision capabilities
- Research-grade tasks requiring strong agentic performance
- Organizations seeking Meta's frontier model capabilities

### Not Ideal For:
- Organizations outside Meta ecosystem
- Applications requiring extensive third-party benchmark validation
- Organizations with strict data sovereignty requirements
- Real-time applications requiring ultra-low latency
- General-purpose applications (other Meta models may offer better value)
- Organizations preferring self-hosting capabilities

